QUALITY CONTROL

    o Removed signatures with invalid or missing BSDB ID, experiment,
      signature, or curated date
    o Removed signatures with missing study, study design, condition,
      reviewer, group names, group 0 name, group 1 definition, EFO ID or source
    o Removed signatures with invalid PMID, DOI URL, year, or group sample sizes
    o Removed signatures with invalid significance threshold (must be
      between 0 and 1) or LDA score (must be between 0 and 20)
    o Removed signatures where abundance in Group 1 is not "increased" or
      "decreased"
    o Removed signatures with incomplete state
